@startuml
actor Cliente
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Lambda Auth CPF + Senha" as Lambda
database "RDS PostgreSQL" as DB

Cliente -> Gateway: POST /auth/cpf\n{ cpf, senha }
Gateway -> Lambda: Evento HTTP
Lambda -> Lambda: Normaliza e valida CPF
Lambda -> DB: Consulta cliente por documento
DB --> Lambda: id, documento, senha_hash, status
Lambda -> Lambda: Verifica status do cliente
Lambda -> Lambda: Compara senha com senha_hash usando bcrypt
Lambda -> Lambda: Gera JWT tipo=CLIENTE\nsub, clienteId, status, iat, exp
Lambda --> Gateway: 200 { tokenType, accessToken, expiresIn }
Gateway --> Cliente: JWT externo
@enduml
